### 8. Delta Table Automatic Optimizations

| Feature | What It Does | Enabled By Default? |
| --- | --- | --- |
| **Auto Optimize (auto-compact)** | Merges small files after writes into \~128 MB files | YES on Databricks |
| **Optimized Writes** | Repartitions data before writing to avoid small files | YES on Databricks |
| **Predictive I/O** | Skips unnecessary file reads using file-level statistics | YES with Photon |
| **Data Skipping** | Uses min/max stats per file to skip irrelevant files | YES — stored in `_delta_log` |
| **Deletion Vectors** | Marks rows as deleted without rewriting files (faster DELETE/MERGE) | YES on newer tables |
| **Z-Ordering** | Co-locates related data in same files by specified columns | MANUAL — `OPTIMIZE table ZORDER BY (col)` |
| **Transaction Log** | ACID guarantees via `_delta_log/` JSON + checkpoint files | Always — this IS Delta |
| **Schema Evolution** | New columns added automatically with `mergeSchema` option | Must be enabled |
| **Time Travel** | Query previous versions: `SELECT * FROM table VERSION AS OF 5` | Always available (retention default 30 days) |

