### 10. File Formats Comparison

| Format | Read Speed | Write Speed | Compression | Schema Evolution | ACID | Best For |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| **Delta (Parquet + Log)** | Fastest (stats, skipping, caching) | Fast (optimized writes) | Excellent | Yes | Yes | Everything on Databricks |
| **Parquet** | Fast (columnar) | Fast | Excellent | Limited | No | External interchange |
| **ORC** | Fast (columnar) | Fast | Good | Limited | No | Hive ecosystem |
| **CSV** | Slow (parse every row) | Fast | Poor | No | No | Human-readable exchange only |
| **JSON** | Slow (parse + nested) | Moderate | Poor | Partial | No | API data, semi-structured |
| **Avro** | Moderate (row-based) | Fast | Good | Yes | No | Streaming, schema evolution |

> **Rule: Always use Delta on Databricks.** The transaction log, auto-optimize, and data skipping are massive advantages.

