### 15. Key Databricks SQL Commands for Diagnostics

| Command | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| `EXPLAIN EXTENDED <query>` | See full logical + physical plan, join strategies, scan types |
| `DESCRIBE DETAIL <table>` | File count, size, partitioning, Delta version, table properties |
| `DESCRIBE HISTORY <table>` | All operations (writes, deletes, optimizes) with timestamps |
| `ANALYZE TABLE <table> COMPUTE STATISTICS` | Compute row counts + column stats for better optimizer decisions |
| `ANALYZE TABLE <table> COMPUTE STATISTICS FOR COLUMNS col1, col2` | Column-level stats (min, max, distinct count, nulls) |
| `OPTIMIZE <table>` | Compact small files, apply Z-ORDER or Liquid Clustering |
| `OPTIMIZE <table> ZORDER BY (col1, col2)` | Co-locate data by columns for faster filtered reads |
| `SHOW TBLPROPERTIES <table>` | See Delta properties (auto-optimize, liquid clustering config) |
| `VACUUM <table> RETAIN 168 HOURS` | Remove old files no longer referenced by Delta log (default 7 days) |
